title: Change order form for painters (free PDF) | Jobchit
description: A free, printable change-order form for painters. Rooms and surfaces, coats, paint and color, the price change, the new total and both signatures. No account needed.
heading: Change order for painters
sub: For when the customer adds a room or changes the color. Fill it in and get both signatures before the extra work starts.
tips:
  - Name each room or surface and the number of coats, for example "hall walls and trim, 2 coats."
  - If the color or sheen changes, write the product and color code, so nobody has to remember it later.
  - Write who buys the paint, and whether this price covers it.
  - Both sides sign and date it before the extra work starts. Give the customer a copy.
  - Some states have their own rules for change orders. Check with your state licensing board.
---
